{c: Chords: the writer's own chart}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]Your call, [Bb]Your voice
[F]Rippling through this body like a [C]current
[Dm]Your Word, [Bb]so close
[F]When waves take over like a [C]torrent
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus 1}
[Bb]Sheltered under mighty wings
[C]Feathers, shaded covering
[Dm]Respite from the brooding, burning [F]swelter
[Bb]Sheltered under mighty wings
[C]Feathers, grounded covering
[Dm]Respite from the brooding, burning [F]swelter
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Bb]You are steady, always [C]here
Always current, always [Dm]near
Ready, I don’t have to [F]fear
Always current, always [Bb]here
You are steady, always [C]here
Always current, always [Dm]near
Ready, I don’t have to [F]fear
Always current, drawing [Dm]near
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]Your soft [Bb]still voice
[F]Surging through my spirit when it’s [C]storming
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus 2}
[Bb]Shallow waters, wading in
[C]Follow as we trust in Him
[Dm]Out into the deep, take a [F]breather
[Bb]Shallow waters, wading in
[C]Follow as we trust in Him
[Dm]Conquering the deep, take a [F]breather
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus 2}
[Bb]You are steady, always [C]here
Always current, always [Dm]near
Ready, I don’t have to [F]fear
Always current, always [Bb]here
You are steady, always [C]here
Always current, always [Dm]near
Ready, I don’t have to [F]fear
Always current, drawing [Bb]near
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
Oh Jesus, Jesus, [C]Jesus
Our almighty [Dm]Jesus
Savior God, the [F]only Jesus [Bb]
Oh Jesus, Jesus, [C]Jesus
Our almighty [Dm]Jesus
Savior God, our [F]only Jesus
{end_of_bridge}
